==About==
'''VALORANT Champions 2026''' (Also known as ''VCT Champions'') is the crowning event of the VALORANT esports calendar. It is also the prestigious event of the {{LeagueIconSmall/v26 tour|link=}} '''V26 Tour''' (''V26无畏巡回'' in Chinese), a year-long roadshow festival where {{LeagueIconSmall/custom|icon=VCT Red logo.png}} '''VCT''' events are held in China.
===Format===
* '''Group Stage:'''
** Four Double-Elimination Format (GSL) Groups
*** Each group has 4 teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 2 teams}} from each group advance to the '''Playoffs'''
*** <span class="mw-customtoggle-GroupStage-Draw" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for detailed information about Group Stage Draw''</span>
<div class="table-responsive">
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-GroupStage-Draw" style="margin-top:10px;" style="margin-left:45px;">
* 16 Teams are divided into 4 pools as per their seeding.
** '''Pool 1''' and '''Pool 2''' consists of teams that qualified through Stage 2 with '''Pool 3''' and '''Pool 4''' consists of team that qualified through Championship Points.
*** '''Pool 1''' consists of '''#1''' - EMEA ''#1'', Americas ''#1'', Pacific ''#1'' & China ''#1''.
*** '''Pool 2''' consists of '''#2''' - EMEA ''#2'', Americas ''#2'', Pacific ''#2'' & China ''#2''.
*** '''Pool 3''' consists of '''Points #1''' - EMEA ''#3'', Americas ''#3'', Pacific ''#3'' & China ''#3''.
*** '''Pool 4''' consists of '''Points #2''' - EMEA ''#4'', Americas ''#4'', Pacific ''#4'' & China ''#4''.
* One team from each Pool will be seeded to each group.
* No Regional Match-ups are allowed.
</div></div>

*'''Playoffs:'''
** 8 team Double-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Lower Bracket Final and Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Lower Bracket Final and Grand Final are {{Abbr/Bo5}}

